            "text": "<h4><em>Threads of Craft. Stories of the Hands That Create.</em></h4><p>The <strong>Crochet Collection by Social India Craft </strong>celebrates the beauty of handmade artistry and the timeless skill of crochet.</p><p>Each creation is carefully handcrafted by <strong>Indian women artisans</strong>, transforming simple threads into thoughtful, functional pieces for everyday life. Every stitch reflects patience, creativity and the individuality of the hands that made it.</p><p>The collection was born from our founder's desire to <strong>bring Indian handmade art forms into contemporary living while creating meaningful livelihood opportunities for artisans</strong>.</p><p>From everyday essentials to thoughtful accessories, each piece is designed to carry the warmth of handmade craftsmanship while remaining practical and beautiful.</p><p><strong>Every stitch carries a story.</strong></p><p><strong>Every creation supports a craft.</strong></p><p><strong>Every purchase helps carry that story forward.</strong></p>"
